  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 6.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et reddatur omnis robaria, si quis aliquam fecerit, et emendet, sicut prius et postea stetit.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone has committed theft, he shall restore all that he has stolen and make amends as has always been the rule.</ab>
      </div>
